    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Nightmare Hunt",
    "summary": "During the opponent's Command phase, in its Battle-shock step, each enemy unit under its **Starting Strength** and within 12\" of any of your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units is forced to test for Battle-shock, with −1 to the result. Enemy units this rule has affected need not take further Battle-shock tests that phase.\n\nAttack modifiers:\n\n- Attacks by your **HERETIC ASTARTES** models get +1 to **Hit rolls** against **Below Half-strength** units.\n- Attacks by your **HERETIC ASTARTES** models get +1 to **Wound rolls** against **Battle-shocked** units.\n- Attacks by Battle-shocked models against your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units get −1 to Hit rolls.",
